They are vendored rather than fetched from a CDN because Fleet has to work on
a machine with no internet, and because a VPS manager should not load code it
did not ship. Refresh them with:

    npm pack @xterm/xterm@6.0.0 @xterm/addon-fit@0.11.0 \
      @xterm/addon-search@0.16.0 @xterm/addon-web-links@0.12.0

After extracting the listed `lib/*.js` and `css/xterm.css` files, verify them
against SHA256SUMS in this directory before committing an update.
